flowchart LR
    action[使用者操作] --> command[建立 Command]
    command --> execute[執行 execute]
    execute --> scene[修改 Scene]
    execute -->|加入| undo[復原堆疊<br/>Undo Stack]
    undo -->|復原 undo| redo[重做堆疊<br/>Redo Stack]
    redo -->|重做 redo| undo

    classDef step fill:#f4f6fb,stroke:#49566b,color:#111,stroke-width:1px;
    class action,command,execute,scene,undo,redo step;
